  "details": "With the most recent discovery about a Derafog video about AI taking over VRC from 2 months ago. I think its safe to say that the platform is in deep trouble for allowing that type of content when the staff is anti AI.\n\nI propose an idea here, that any person that uploads something that has generative AI to VRC, will have it removed and is given a warning. Repetitive offenders trying again to upload will be banned.\n\nReduce the slop, save the platform",
